WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:19.240
I'm not surprised in the slightest.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.010
I saw this coming a long time ago.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.340
You're the one who went looking for work 
in the underworld in search of a quick euru.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:33.120
And you're the one who paid 
the price for losing a match.

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:41.370
You crushed the talent I spent so much 
time developing, with your own hands.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:45.840
Honestly, I want back 
the time I spent training you.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:49.270
Rose, this is the last time I'll teach you.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.660
Fortunately, there's someone 
else who's shown promise.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:55.690
I'm going to devote my 
time to teaching them.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.690
W-Who are they?

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.560
There's no need for you to know.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:05.840
You're a fool of a woman.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:29.860
Y-Your arm...

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:31.560
A prosthetic?

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.440
She was golfing with a prosthetic arm?

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:36.820
Don't look so surprised.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:41.560
It's the price I've paid 
for my life in the underworld.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:45.380
Now, let's get back to it.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:49.130
I haven't lost anything yet.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.480
Call off the game!

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:28.970
We can't continue the game 
after Rose lost an arm!

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:31.570
Now, that's an odd thing to say.

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:35.940
I believe our rule was that the game 
continued until we had a winner?

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:40.530
Th-Then, at least stop the game 
until Rose's arm is repaired—

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.360
No, I don't believe that will be happening.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:45.280
The game continues.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.950
Y-You okay?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:51.420
Quiet. It's just a busted prosthetic.

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:52.950
I see.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:56.380
That explains how you hit so many drives.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.200
Full-power shots put a lot 
of strain on the wrists.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.640
You were able to do so many in a row 
because your prosthetic took the impact for you.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:09.420
Neat trick. But now your arm's busted.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.140
You're finished.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.470
You can't beat Eve with one hand.

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:16.070
Not yet. Her eyes aren't dead yet.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.710
Her heart's not broken yet.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.300
Yeah, that's right.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:23.000
My flames are burning as bright as ever.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:26.730
Then I'll just have to 
keep firing my bullets.

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.570
Until they break you.

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:34.040
Before that happens... 
I'll burn you to cinders.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.540
<i>Final Bullet</i>

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.300
They're working overtime 
on the construction job.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.120
Slack off, damn it! Don't work so hard!

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:49.820
They're going to start working 
on our block by nightfall!

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:52.160
We need to get out of here before then!

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:58.180
Rose told us to stay here 
until Eve comes back.

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:00.970
But we can't get a hold of her at all!

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.740
If she doesn't come back...

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.550
She will.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.480
Let's believe in her...

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.080
<i>In Eve!</i>

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:14.530
Don't take it easy on her just 
because she's got a handicap now!

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:16.250
I won't. I can't.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.880
I know that wounded beasts are the fiercest.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:24.920
<i>I didn't think I'd lose in a range contest 
with my full-power shot.</i>

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:29.260
<i>Fortunately, there's someone 
else who's shown promise.</i>

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:32.260
<i>I'm going to devote my 
time to teaching them.</i>

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:33.760
<i>Eve...</i>

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.450
Is it you?

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:42.770
Who are you?

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:46.480
You must be pretty new if you don't know me.

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:50.650
If you want to do betting golf, 
you need to say hello to me at least.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.480
Come to take your cut or something?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:55.120
Hit it.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.990
With your driver. Hard as you can.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.880
<i>Direct Strike...</i>

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:06.550
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.480
There you go.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.560
Is that all?

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.060
What?

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.300
Come work for me.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:26.940
I'll set you up with bigger games.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.350
I'm not going to work for the mafia.

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:33.330
My big sis told me that if I 
did, it'd be the death of me.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:35.160
I see.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.810
Well, do what you want, then.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.360
<i>You kept your distance from me,</i>

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:46.920
<i>until one day you came to my office.</i>

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:51.920
<i>To fight that Japanese girl, Aoi Amawashi.</i>

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.820
<i>Give it up. We're criminals. 
We live outside the spotlight.</i>

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:59.400
<i>And they live by all the little rules 
and regulations that we ignore.</i>

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.940
<i>And she's super-rich, too.</i>

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.860
<i>It's a miracle you ever 
even got to talk to her.</i>

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.490
I didn't come here 
to hear your opinion on it.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:10.640
You want to fight this 
Japanese girl that bad?

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:11.700
Why?

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:15.160
Because I've got a good enough reason.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:20.320
<i>I was sure that you were 
leaving the underworld forever.</i>

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.960
<i>You were taking a different path than me.</i>

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.880
<i>That was fine by me.</i>

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:31.200
<i>I even set it up so you could 
leave this shithole of a town.</i>

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:33.200
<i>But...</i>

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:37.230
<i>I still haven't accepted 
that you're strong enough.</i>

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:41.020
<i>There are any number of things you'll need 
to survive outside the underworld:</i>

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.240
<i>things you don't have!</i>

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:47.000
<i>So... surpass me!</i>

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.910
<i>My flames haven't burnt out yet!</i>

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.660
<i>Now burn bright...!</i>

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:54.570
<i>Crimson...</i>

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.780
<i>Rose Bullet!</i>

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:14.080
She got that distance with just one arm?

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.400
I told you.

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.560
I've lost nothing.

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:21.930
140 yards to the pin.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:26.430
That's my distance. The one I'm best at.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:30.210
Wounded animals are the scariest around.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:35.280
Can you hit another slice like you did 
off the tee, this time with a 3 Wood?

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.650
I've only ever used a driver.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.030
Then go dead straight.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:43.120
Get as close to the left 
side of the woods as you can.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.200
I know.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:49.660
<i>Sis, Lily... everyone...</i>

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.170
<i>Just hang in there a little longer.</i>

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.010
<i>Direct Strike...</i>

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.640
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.560
<i>I'm going to win, and come back!</i>

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:15.730
117 yards to the pin?

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.240
Even if this hole ends in a draw,

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.320
we still have the advantage.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:22.160
This should be an easy win.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.490
Prepare the champagne.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.940
<i>140 yards to the hole.</i>

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:30.190
<i>You deliberately eased off on the shot.</i>

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:33.920
<i>To get it to the distance 
you're strongest at...</i>

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:37.900
Go for it. I believe in you.

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:40.820
Anri, watch closely.

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:44.120
This will probably be my last shot.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:45.850
Rose...

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:49.190
I mean I'm going to win.

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.920
<i>Ever since I lost my right arm,</i>

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:58.520
<i>No, ever since I met you, Eve, 
I've been wondering...</i>

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:03.340
<i>What would've happened if I 
hadn't decided to live underground?</i>

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.960
<i>It's pointless to wonder.</i>

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:09.060
<i>But now, I can know for sure!</i>

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:12.640
<i>If I beat you before you 
leave this life forever,</i>

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:15.620
<i>then I can look back on my life with regret!</i>

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:19.530
<i>This is the last shot of Rose Aleon,</i>

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:24.560
<i>the last shot of my life as a golfer!</i>

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:26.260
<i>Crimson...</i>

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:29.850
<i>Rose Bullet!</i>

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.310
A perfect shot?

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:36.420
Under this much pressure?

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.210
It's going to reach the pin!

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:42.640
Go!

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.070
Go!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.960
Just get in the damn hole!

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:50.840
B-Boss...

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.280
I-Impossible!

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.720
No, impossible!

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.880
Go in!

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.760
Go in!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.650
Go in!!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.970
So close!

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.910
But this puts her under a lot of pressure.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:17.400
Yes.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.150
One missed shot,

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.040
and we lose.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:26.020
Just aim for a tie this hole.

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:27.690
Get it on the green no matter what.

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:29.320
Get me my pitching wedge.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.660
You can't get to the green with that!

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:35.820
I want to look back... on everything!

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.940
Since this will be my last shot!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.960
Okay, here you go.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.640
<i>Load the bullet.</i>

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:55.050
<i>Cock the hammer.</i>

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.700
<i>Aim.</i>

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:00.070
<i>Pull the trigger.</i>

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:02.270
<i>And fire it from the barrel!</i>

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.290
<i>Heaven's...</i>

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.620
<i>Red Bullet!</i>

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:15.440
They're coming! They're almost here!

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.210
We're out of time. Come with me, Lily.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.320
Stay right behind me.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.230
Sorry I'm late!

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.130
Eve?

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.990
Where have you been?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.570
We'll talk later!

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:45.460
Get in!

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:46.660
It's a little cramped, sorry!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.160
You didn't need to say that last part.

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.210
Where are we going?

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:56.390
To the hotel I made reservations for, first.

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.290
And then?

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.600
After that, we go wherever you want.

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.970
We can do anything. Be anyone.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.270
Eve!

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:06.850
Where'd you get all this money?

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.680
Look at all the money!

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:13.740
We've turned our lives around!

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:16.720
We're escaping to freedom!

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:27.160
You get your IDs?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.660
I've got one for each of you.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.510
Your names will change a little,

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:34.700
but they're all nice and squeaky clean!

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:40.170
With these, the kids can go to school.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.800
And get jobs, too.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.510
Of course, you'll have to 
start paying taxes...

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:50.060
How'd you get IDs?

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:51.990
<i>We snakes keep our ear to the ground.</i>

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.570
Way to go, snake woman.

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:55.570
<i>Vipère!</i>

00:13:55.570 --> 00:13:57.080
How much did it cost?

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.390
<i>Don't worry about it.</i>

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:00.060
<i>It's a little present from me.</i>

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.270
Um...

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:07.620
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:11.640
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:12.560
Bye.

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:17.120
I'm retiring from betting golf.

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:20.460
You need to have more fun in life.

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:21.650
Yup.

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:35.140
Hey! No jumping in the pool!

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.400
Sorry, so...

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:38.890
So how long will it take to do?

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:41.730
I see. Understood.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.320
Yes, thank you.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:47.780
They say they can rebuild 
the shop in a week.

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:52.620
And I got the kids enrolled in school, too.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:57.760
You and I will run the shop.

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:00.700
And the kids will study at school.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:04.170
And what will Eve do?

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.290
Golf, of course.

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.410
Not betting golf.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:12.430
Real golf. The sport of the refined.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.220
Yeah, that's right.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.470
It's all she's got.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:20.250
But where is she?

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.550
She just got a call from the front desk.

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:25.680
I think she's meeting someone.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.490
So, what do you want?

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:34.530
Why?

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.430
Why?

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:38.120
Why did it have to be you?

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:43.710
She cared about you so much...

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:55.240
You're a spoiled brat! You make me so mad!

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:58.840
You're the bitch who beat her!

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:00.750
But...

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:04.750
I'll tell you something
so I can sleep better at night.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:12.160
That old hag Catherine flew into a rage 
after the loss and sent a hitman after her.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:13.960
After Rose?

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:16.240
And you, too.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:20.650
That's what it means 
to get involved with the mafia!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.950
If you don't want to die, leave this city.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:26.700
God knows I am.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.290
I'm not dying for this shit.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.420
Bye!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.510
I'll never see you again, 
and I don't want to!

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:39.720
Just live your own life, and then die!!

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.760
Yeah... I will.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.120
I'll live and die how I want to.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:59.320
Why does it take so long 
to get anything done at the city hall?

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.160
And this name's weird.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.610
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.080
Eve!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.880
How did you find me?

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:18.900
Rose called us!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:20.510
We heard what's going on!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.130
Take this with you!

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:26.430
It's got money. Clothes. 
Everything you'll need!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.260
I'm sorry, Eve!

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:31.010
You put yourself in danger for us!

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:33.850
I just did it on my own.

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:38.130
Eve, we're going to live our lives 
as decent, respectable people!

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:40.150
Leave the kids to us.

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:42.690
Yeah, I'm counting on you.

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:53.760
You're going to Japan, 
to meet that Japanese girl!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.590
To play golf!

00:17:57.610 --> 00:17:59.480
You're coming back, right?

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.040
We'll be waiting for you!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.320
Eve! Thank you!

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:09.010
We'll be happy here, okay? So...

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.650
Eve!

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:17.680
Play golf, the sport you love!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.340
What's your name?

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:42.520
Evangeline...

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.090
And your last name?

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:48.610
I don't know.

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.690
The money went through.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.320
Let's get something good 
to eat on the way home.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.520
Can we get dessert? Can we?

00:18:57.390 --> 00:18:58.870
Just for today.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.990
Presents? What did you bring?

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.110
Sweets?

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:03.440
Toys?

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:05.290
Get this: Both!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:08.680
Yay! Yay!

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:07.060
That bitch...

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:14.490
It went a little to the right... 
It's going to miss!

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:41.560
She kicked my ass. Literally.

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:51.690
Tell me what I'm doing here.

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:52.850
You and I are done—

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.080
Tell me.

00:20:54.590 --> 00:20:56.850
What's the difference between me and Eve?

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.250
You know the answer.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:02.680
Ambition.

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:06.430
One of you defeats weaker players,

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:12.380
enjoying the feeling of superiority 
she gets from earning petty cash.

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:15.330
One of you wants to fight stronger players,

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.840
and is always hungry for more.

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:20.690
She was the latter.

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:23.080
That's the only difference.

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:27.340
If you're that taken, 
why did you leave her?

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:32.430
Because I realized I couldn't 
bring out her full potential.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:36.850
Until what's sleeping 
within her awakens, that is.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.360
What's sleeping within her?

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:40.560
Yes.

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:45.580
She'll never be a true 
golfer until it awakens.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.570
And if it does?

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:52.270
The world of golf will be drowned...

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:54.330
...in a rain of bullets.

00:21:55.320 --> 00:21:56.840
I see.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:21:59.790
So I don't even get my regrets, huh?

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:05.290
<i>Nafrece Air Flight 224 
will soon be taking off.</i>

00:22:05.750 --> 00:22:07.960
Someday, in the real world,

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:09.760
you'll come to play against me as a regular player, 
not by special invitation, right?

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:13.240
<i>you'll come to play against me as a regular player, 
not by special invitation, right?</i>

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:15.630
<i>Yes, I will.</i>

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:20.100
<i>Give me everything you have...</i>

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:21.880
<i>I will.</i>

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:26.680
<i>I'll play golf with you!</i>

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:30.780
Never call me again.

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:33.440
Unlike you, I'm a busy person.

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:45.030
I'll never get the chance.

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:15.950
Go, Eve.

00:23:16.390 --> 00:23:18.450
To where the sun shines!

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:24.930
<i>To the world I turned my eyes away from!</i>

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:31.830
Wait, this is free?

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:32.440
No way!

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:35.930
Then bring me more! 
As many cups as you've got!

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:37.600
Yeah, thanks!

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:49.980
Next Episode

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:43.230
I'm Saotome, with the Raiou Golf Team!

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:45.920
I showed up a little in Episode 3, 
and starting next episode, I'm a main character!

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:47.010
Hey, do you know a girl named Aoi?

00:23:47.010 --> 00:23:47.870
Nope!

00:23:47.870 --> 00:23:49.870
Next time, let's Birdie Birdie!
